WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.434 --> 00:00:03.467
"Jurassic World: Dominion"
hits theaters June 10th.

00:00:03.467 --> 00:00:05.767
Chris and I are about to do
the "Face It Challenge."

00:00:05.767 --> 00:00:06.901
Here we go.

00:00:06.901 --> 00:00:08.200
-♪ Face it ♪
-♪ Face it ♪

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:12.634
-♪ Face it ♪
-♪ Face It Challenge ♪

00:00:12.634 --> 00:00:15.200
-Now here's how it works.
Each round, I'll draw a card,

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:18.601
which will tell us what face
we both have to make, okay?

00:00:18.601 --> 00:00:21.767
Then we'll look in our mirrors,
make our faces,

00:00:21.767 --> 00:00:23.634
and then reveal them
on the count of three,

00:00:23.634 --> 00:00:25.467
and we'll stare at each other
for 10 seconds.

00:00:25.467 --> 00:00:27.000
-Oh! Got it.
-Uh-huh.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:29.067
-So we both
are making the same face.

00:00:29.067 --> 00:00:30.601
-Correct.
-Now I get it.

00:00:30.601 --> 00:00:32.901
-Now, the first person
to crack a smile, laugh,

00:00:32.901 --> 00:00:34.701
or break the face loses.
-Oh, no.

00:00:34.701 --> 00:00:35.701
Okay.
-Okay?

00:00:35.701 --> 00:00:36.868
Let's see
what our first face is.

00:00:36.868 --> 00:00:39.067
Here we go.

00:00:39.067 --> 00:00:41.167
All right, this one's
"holding in a yawn."

00:00:41.167 --> 00:00:43.901
-Okay, okay.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:43.901 --> 00:00:45.100
-All right.
Hold on.

00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:46.300
[ Laughs ]
Wait, hold on.

00:00:46.300 --> 00:00:48.300
[ Laughter ]

00:00:50.467 --> 00:00:54.567
[ Laughter ]
Wait, all right.

00:00:54.567 --> 00:00:59.100
3, 2, 1, go.

00:00:59.100 --> 00:01:02.901
[ Laughter ]

00:01:02.901 --> 00:01:04.167
[ Buzzer ]

00:01:04.167 --> 00:01:05.767
Holding in a yawn?
-Unh-unh.

00:01:05.767 --> 00:01:08.367
-[ Laughs ]
I was like...

00:01:08.367 --> 00:01:09.801
That was a good yawn!
-I didn't even do

00:01:09.801 --> 00:01:10.834
"holding in a yawn."

00:01:10.834 --> 00:01:11.834
I just tried
to make you me laugh.

00:01:11.834 --> 00:01:13.033
-You made me laugh.
All right,

00:01:13.033 --> 00:01:15.534
that's an interesting strategy.
I like that.

00:01:15.534 --> 00:01:17.434
I was actually
trying to swallow one.

00:01:17.434 --> 00:01:18.734
All right.
Let's do another one here.

00:01:18.734 --> 00:01:23.033
This is...
"pretending you love a present."

00:01:23.033 --> 00:01:25.200
-Oh, got it, got it.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:26.400 --> 00:01:33.968
[ Laughter ]

00:01:33.968 --> 00:01:37.501
-All right.
Three, two, one.

00:01:37.501 --> 00:01:39.133
[ Laughter ]

00:01:39.133 --> 00:01:40.501
[ Buzzer ]

00:01:40.501 --> 00:01:42.734
♪♪

00:01:42.734 --> 00:01:43.734
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:43.734 --> 00:01:45.234
I did the same face.

00:01:45.234 --> 00:01:48.167
[ Both laugh ]

00:01:48.167 --> 00:01:49.367
That was a good bit.

00:01:49.367 --> 00:01:52.400
You did the same face!
That's so funny!

00:01:52.400 --> 00:01:53.734
Gosh, that's such
a good strategy.

00:01:53.734 --> 00:01:56.200
-I won't do it --
-No, but that was so funny.

00:01:56.200 --> 00:01:57.701
You're "pretending
to hold a yawn" face.

00:01:57.701 --> 00:01:59.400
-Yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:59.400 --> 00:02:01.367
-That's the only face you make.
It's very funny.

00:02:01.367 --> 00:02:02.734
It's very funny.
-I won't do it again.

00:02:02.734 --> 00:02:04.300
That's good.
Here we go.

00:02:04.300 --> 00:02:06.801
Let's do another one.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:06.801 --> 00:02:09.133
"Cinco de Mayo at 3:00 a.m."
-Oh, yeah!

00:02:09.133 --> 00:02:13.767
[ Laughter ]

00:02:13.767 --> 00:02:14.868
♪♪

00:02:14.868 --> 00:02:18.000
-[ Laughs ]

00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:22.667
[ Laughter ]

00:02:22.667 --> 00:02:25.767
-All right, three, two, one.

00:02:25.767 --> 00:02:26.701
-[ Laughs ]

00:02:26.701 --> 00:02:30.000
[ Buzzer ]

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:32.434
Stop doing that.

00:02:32.434 --> 00:02:35.534
Stop doing that!
[ Both laugh ]

00:02:35.534 --> 00:02:36.734
-All right, all right.

00:02:36.734 --> 00:02:38.934
I'm gonna actually do
a real one this time.

00:02:38.934 --> 00:02:40.801
[ Laughter ]

00:02:40.801 --> 00:02:42.701
-It's so stupid,
it makes me laugh.

00:02:42.701 --> 00:02:45.434
Oh, I love it.
All right, here's one.

00:02:45.434 --> 00:02:47.234
There's one more round.
Here's the last one here.

00:02:47.234 --> 00:02:48.934
This one is --
Oh, you'll be good at this.

00:02:48.934 --> 00:02:50.734
-Yeah, I got this one.

00:02:50.734 --> 00:02:53.767
-"Velociraptor is standing
right behind you."

00:02:53.767 --> 00:02:55.901
-Like, you're trying
to convey to a person

00:02:55.901 --> 00:02:57.334
that they're standing
right behind you, or --

00:02:57.334 --> 00:02:59.033
Yeah, yes, 'cause otherwise,
you wouldn't know

00:02:59.033 --> 00:03:01.467
if it was standing behind you.
-No, I think you would know.

00:03:01.467 --> 00:03:02.968
-I'm telling you
that a velociraptor

00:03:02.968 --> 00:03:04.534
is standing behind you,
or am I just --

00:03:04.534 --> 00:03:05.968
-Would you know?

00:03:05.968 --> 00:03:07.167
-'Cause if they're standing
behind you, I'd just be making

00:03:07.167 --> 00:03:08.167
this face.
I wouldn't know.

00:03:08.167 --> 00:03:09.734
-I know, but what --
-They're sneaky.

00:03:09.734 --> 00:03:11.167
-Oh, they are sneaky.
-I wouldn't know.

00:03:11.167 --> 00:03:12.567
-You wouldn't really know?

00:03:12.567 --> 00:03:14.167
-I'd know.
-Right.

00:03:14.167 --> 00:03:15.567
[ Laughter ]

00:03:15.567 --> 00:03:17.234
I'm a scientist.
I know these things.

00:03:17.234 --> 00:03:20.400
A velociraptor is standing
behind me, and I know.

00:03:20.400 --> 00:03:22.334
-Okay.
So, the idea is that

00:03:22.334 --> 00:03:24.734
I'm gonna have to do it --
My thing is, I'm gonna

00:03:24.734 --> 00:03:27.033
be telling you that there is
a velociraptor behind you,

00:03:27.033 --> 00:03:29.701
like, over there.
-Or is it that

00:03:29.701 --> 00:03:33.367
that's happening, and you're
like, "What just happened?"

00:03:33.367 --> 00:03:34.467
[ Laughter ]

00:03:34.467 --> 00:03:36.000
Like, I don't think it's just --

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:38.033
"I don't know
what's standing behind me."

00:03:38.033 --> 00:03:39.834
Is there something behind me?
-Can we keep it moving?

00:03:39.834 --> 00:03:40.934
[ Laughter ]

00:03:40.934 --> 00:03:42.367
Is there something
behind me right now?

00:03:42.367 --> 00:03:44.100
-Yeah, that's gonna be the face.

00:03:44.100 --> 00:03:46.367
I'm doing there's a velociraptor
standing behind you.

00:03:46.367 --> 00:03:50.467
-Oh, I'm doing there's a
velociraptor standing behind me.

00:03:50.467 --> 00:03:53.567
[ Laughter ]

00:03:53.567 --> 00:03:55.000
-Okay.
-You know what I'm saying?

00:03:55.000 --> 00:03:56.234
-Yeah, all right.
-Yeah, yeah.

00:03:56.234 --> 00:03:57.601
-We got this.

00:03:57.601 --> 00:04:00.501
-Oh, no, you're right.
It's standing right behind you.

00:04:00.501 --> 00:04:01.868
-Like, there's a velo--
Is it in quotes?

00:04:01.868 --> 00:04:03.868
-No.
[ Laughter ]

00:04:03.868 --> 00:04:06.467
"You" is in quotes.
-Yeah.

00:04:06.467 --> 00:04:09.067
-It's standing behind "you."
Yeah, "you" is in quotes.

00:04:09.067 --> 00:04:11.234
-Is there an emphasis?
[ Laughter ]

00:04:11.234 --> 00:04:12.701
-There's an emphasis
on "behind."

00:04:12.701 --> 00:04:14.367
Okay. Ready?
-Let's poll the audience.

00:04:14.367 --> 00:04:15.400
Do you have "Millionaire"
technology?

00:04:15.400 --> 00:04:16.834
Can we poll the audience?
-Here we go.

00:04:16.834 --> 00:04:18.767
-Oh, God.

00:04:18.767 --> 00:04:21.133
-"Velociraptor standing
right behind you."

00:04:21.133 --> 00:04:22.501
-Okay.

00:04:22.501 --> 00:04:24.701
-[ Laughs ]
Same thing as me.

00:04:24.701 --> 00:04:27.300
Okay. Behind you.
-Yeah, yeah.

00:04:27.300 --> 00:04:33.968
[ Laughter ]

00:04:33.968 --> 00:04:36.968
Three, two, one.

00:04:36.968 --> 00:04:38.000
[ Laughs ]

00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:39.767
[ Buzzer ]

00:04:39.767 --> 00:04:41.667
I knew you were gonna do it.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:41.667 --> 00:04:43.968
Chris Pratt, everybody!
That's how you do it.

00:04:43.968 --> 00:04:45.467
That's how you make me laugh.

00:04:45.467 --> 00:04:46.968
Oh, you're a funny dude.
Love you, bud.

